{
  "name": "VoiceHelper — Voice dictation at your text cursor for macOS",
  "short_name": "VoiceHelper",
  "description": "Free local dictation app for macOS 13+. Press ⌥Space, speak, and insert text directly at the cursor in Terminal, VS Code, browsers, or messengers without losing focus. Local Whisper on Apple Silicon Metal, Deepgram Streaming, and OpenAI / Groq.",
